###
# API Collection: Extract File Text
#
# This file contains example HTTP requests for testing the `/extract-file-text` API endpoint.
#
# Purpose:
#   - To extract text content from various file types (PDF, DOCX, XLSX) by providing their URLs.
#
# Usage:
#   - Each section demonstrates a POST request for a different file type.
#   - The API expects a JSON body with a `file_url` parameter.
#
# Example file types covered:
#   - PDF (simple, with images)
#   - DOCX
#   - XLSX
###

### Local variables
@extractFileTextEndpoint = {{host}}/extract-file-text

### PDF: simple electronic pdf
POST {{extractFileTextEndpoint}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "file_url": "{{testFilesPath}}/sample-invoice.pdf"
}

### PDF: electronic pdf with images
POST {{extractFileTextEndpoint}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "file_url": "{{testFilesPath}}/electronic-pdf-with-images.pdf"
}

### DOCX: simple document with docx extension
POST {{extractFileTextEndpoint}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "file_url": "{{testFilesPath}}/document-with-docx-ext.docx"
}

### XLSX: simple document with xlsx extension
POST {{extractFileTextEndpoint}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "file_url": "{{testFilesPath}}/document-with-xlsx-ext.xlsx"
}